# Potential Persistence Via Outlook Form | T1137.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_office_outlook_newform.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=11 Image="*\\outlook.exe" (TargetFilename IN ("*\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\FORMS\\IPM*", "*\\Local Settings\\Application Data\\Microsoft\\Forms*"))
